<title>USA: ReliaStar completes Successful Money deal.</title>
<headline>ReliaStar completes Successful Money deal.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>ReliaStar Financial Corp said Tuesday it completed the acquisition of Successful Money Management Seminars Inc, a provider of personal finance educational seminars.</p>
<p>ReliaStar, which said last month it agreed to acquire Successful Money Management, did not disclose terms of the deal.</p>
<p>The company said the transaction would not have a material effect on its financial results.</p>
<p>-- Reuter Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
